  "description": "Jae-In witnesses her crush, Hyun-Ho, receive a confession and decides then and there to bury her feelings. The two remain close friends beyond high school. After a secret piercing Jae-In got as a small act of rebellion against her parents becomes infected, she has only one person to turn to for help: Hyun-Ho. His idea of treatment lands them in some compromising situations, forcing Jae-In to decide whether she’s willing to risk the happiness she’s found at his side—or take a chance on something more.\n\n(Source: Tapas)\n\n*Note: Includes six extra chapters.*",
